  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7902.06 Vulnerable Adult Safety Programs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7902.06 Vulnerable Adult Safety Programs. The department shall include on the department's website a link to the Alzheimer’s Association, as well as a link to the MedicAlert foundation for caregivers to enroll individuals who are predisposed to wandering incidents due to a cognitive issue, and who therefore might be reported as a missing vulnerable adult, in the MedicAlert + Safe Return program or similar programs that aid in the safe return of missing vulnerable adults.\n\nSource. #14199, eff 2-25-25\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c7900.html"
